      "writtenOn": "2023-12-08T17:45:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "A lot of how these colorTypes are used in here is not setup well. But really the wrapping was originally meant for things that we never plan on having a colorType for (e.g. YUV formats) so it was meant to say don\u0027t use this colorType at all. But IIRC last time I checked we aren\u0027t actually even using the wrapping flag in any queries.\n\nNow for this specific use case, there shouldn\u0027t be any issues with us uploading data to this format is someone asked us to (even if ChomeOS isn\u0027t using that feature). So the Upload flag seems correct here to me.",
